msgstr "Istogramma / statistiche rielaborati in API a oggetti *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"The histogram/statistics surface was reworked into object-based "
"``image.get_histogram()`` / ``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()`` "
"returning histogram/statistics objects. The old flat histogram/statistics "
"results and the ``bin_count`` / ``l_bin_count`` / ``a_bin_count`` / "
"``b_bin_count`` methods were removed (use ``len(histogram.bins())`` etc.)."
msgstr ""
"La superficie di istogramma/statistiche è stata rielaborata in "
"``image.get_histogram()`` / ``get_statistics()`` / ``get_percentile()`` "
"basate su oggetti, che restituiscono oggetti istogramma/statistiche. I "
"vecchi risultati piatti di istogramma/statistiche e i metodi ``bin_count`` /"
" ``l_bin_count`` / ``a_bin_count`` / ``b_bin_count`` sono stati rimossi (usa"
" ``len(histogram.bins())`` ecc.)."

