msgid "For a clean port to v2.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Per un porting pulito alla v2.1.0 il lavoro tipico è:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Sostituisci ``image.FREAK`` con ``image.ORB``\\ , elimina l'argomento del "
"tipo di descrittore e aggiorna l'unpacking della tupla di "
"``match_descriptor()`` / ``draw_keypoints()`` all'oggetto keypoint (\\ "
":ref:`la rielaborazione ORB <v2_1_0_orb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinomina ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` nelle forme ``set_auto_*`` (\\ :ref:`la "
"rinominazione delle funzioni automatiche <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr ""
"Sposta il codice di istogramma/statistiche ai metodi a oggetti (\\ :ref:`la "
"rielaborazione di istogramma/statistiche <v2_1_0_histogram>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinomina ``scale=`` di ``find_features()`` in ``scale_factor=`` (\\ :ref:`la"
" rinominazione di find_features <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Usa gli accessor degli oggetti blob e sostituisci ``find_markers()`` con "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (\\ :ref:`la modifica a find_blobs "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`\\ ); sostituisci ``img.copy_to_fb()`` con il keyword "
"``copy_to_fb=`` (\\ :ref:`la modifica a copy_to_fb <v2_1_0_copytofb>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"Limita la qualità di ``compress()`` a 1–100 e ricontrolla le dimensioni JPEG"
" sull'OpenMV 3 (\\ :ref:`la modifica a compress <v2_1_0_compress>`\\ ); "
"riaffina lo zoom di ``lens_corr()`` (\\ :ref:`la modifica a lens_corr "
"<v2_1_0_lenscorr>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tutti gli altri script funzionano senza modifiche."
